{"title":"Career Roadmap · Drama Teacher","role":"Drama Teacher","summary":"A Drama Teacher teaches theatre, acting, performance, storytelling, improvisation, stagecraft, and dramatic expression to students.","facts":{"Current degree":"BPA (Bachelor of Performing Arts)","Course":"Theatre / Acting"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Drama Teacher teaches theatre, acting, performance, storytelling, improvisation, stagecraft, and dramatic expression to students."},{"type":"p","text":"Drama Teachers can work in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Schools"},{"text":"International schools"},{"text":"Performing-arts academies"},{"text":"Theatre institutions"},{"text":"Colleges and universities"},{"text":"Community arts organizations"},{"text":"Children's theatre programs"},{"text":"Summer/winter camps"},{"text":"EdTech and performing-arts platforms"},{"text":"Private acting academies"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["The role combines performing arts expertise","teaching ability","classroom management","creative direction."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"For a BPA graduate, the pathway can develop as:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BPA – Theatre / Acting","Theatre Training + Teaching Practicum","Drama / Theatre Instructor","Drama Teacher","Senior Drama Teacher","Theatre / Performing Arts Coordinator","Head of Performing Arts"]}]},{"heading":"Career Pathway","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Stage 1 — Build Theatre Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"During BPA, develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Acting"},{"text":"Voice"},{"text":"Movement"},{"text":"Theatre history"},{"text":"Script analysis"},{"text":"Improvisation"},{"text":"Stagecraft"},{"text":"Theatre production"},{"text":"Performance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Stage 2 — Gain Teaching Experience"},{"type":"p","text":"Start with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Drama Instructor"},{"text":"Theatre Instructor"},{"text":"Performing Arts Teacher"},{"text":"Acting Coach"},{"text":"Theatre Workshop Facilitator"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Stage 3 — School-Level Drama Teaching"},{"type":"p","text":"Progress into:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Drama Teacher"},{"text":"Theatre Teacher"},{"text":"Performing Arts Teacher"},{"text":"School Theatre Director"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Stage 4 — Leadership"},{"type":"p","text":"With experience:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Senior Drama Teacher"},{"text":"Theatre Coordinator"},{"text":"Performing Arts Coordinator"},{"text":"Head of Performing Arts"},{"text":"Theatre Program Director"}]}]},{"heading":"What You Learn During BPA","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong Theatre/Acting program can cover:"},{"type":"table","header":["Area","Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Acting"},{"text":"Characterization, scene work, performance"}],[{"text":"Voice"},{"text":"Projection, articulation, vocal expression"}],[{"text":"Movement"},{"text":"Body awareness, stage movement"}],[{"text":"Theatre"},{"text":"History, forms, traditions"}],[{"text":"Direction"},{"text":"Blocking, rehearsal management"}],[{"text":"Script"},{"text":"Analysis, interpretation"}],[{"text":"Improvisation"},{"text":"Spontaneity, ensemble work"}],[{"text":"Production"},{"text":"Stage, lighting, costume, props"}],[{"text":"Performance"},{"text":"Live theatre and presentation"}],[{"text":"Education"},{"text":"Workshop and teaching methods"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"The exact curriculum varies by institution."}]},{"heading":"Year 1 — Theatre Foundations","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Theatre history"},{"text":"Acting fundamentals"},{"text":"Voice training"},{"text":"Movement"},{"text":"Improvisation"},{"text":"Stage confidence"},{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Observation skills"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Core exercises"},{"type":"p","text":"Voice"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Movement"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Observation"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Improvisation"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"flow","items":["Expression","Basic Acting Ability"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Acting & Theatre Practice"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Character development"},{"text":"Script analysis"},{"text":"Scene study"},{"text":"Monologue performance"},{"text":"Improvisational theatre"},{"text":"Ensemble acting"},{"text":"Stage movement"},{"text":"Voice modulation"},{"text":"Emotional expression"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Start participating in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"College productions"},{"text":"Theatre festivals"},{"text":"Street plays"},{"text":"Workshops"},{"text":"Short films"},{"text":"Community theatre"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Directing & Teaching"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop skills in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Directing"},{"text":"Blocking"},{"text":"Rehearsal planning"},{"text":"Group management"},{"text":"Theatre production"},{"text":"Theatre pedagogy"},{"text":"Workshop design"},{"text":"Age-appropriate activities"},{"text":"Performance assessment"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to convert theatre techniques into structured learning experiences."}]},{"heading":"Final Year — Teaching Portfolio","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Build a professional teaching portfolio containing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Drama lesson plans"},{"text":"Theatre workshop plans"},{"text":"Student activities"},{"text":"Improvisation exercises"},{"text":"Theatre production plan"},{"text":"Assessment rubrics"},{"text":"Performance recordings"},{"text":"Directed production"},{"text":"Teaching practicum"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The objective is to demonstrate:"},{"type":"h","text":"\"I can teach theatre, not merely perform theatre.\""}]},{"heading":"Core Drama Teaching Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Drama Teacher should be able to teach:"},{"type":"h","tex